custom home designed to maximise space, natural light and functionality on a compact 240sqm allotment. Despite the site’s size, this 22-square residence delivers a spacious and modern family environment through clever design, quality finishes and efficient use of every square metre.","a3c9646c59f8",[346],[],"h2",{"_206":221,"_208":222,"_223":347,"_225":348},[],"Overview",{"_350":351,"_352":353,"_354":355},"settings",{"_413":414,"_415":416,"_417":418,"_419":420,"_421":113,"_422":423,"_424":-5,"_425":426,"_427":377,"_428":-5,"_429":-5,"_430":377,"_431":432,"_433":434,"_435":436,"_437":438,"_439":-5,"_440":441,"_442":443,"_140":444,"_445":446,"_447":448},"navigation",{"_374":375,"_376":377,"_378":379,"_380":381},"services",[356,357,358,359,360,361],{"_225":372,"_30":373},{"_225":370,"_30":371},{"_225":368,"_30":369},{"_225":366,"_30":367},{"_225":364,"_30":365},{"_225":362,"_30":363},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[402,403,404,405,406,407],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[387,388,389,390],"socialMenu",[382],{"_383":-5,"_384":385,"_159":386},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_384":-5,"_392":400,"_394":401},{"_384":-5,"_392":398,"_394":399},{"_384":-5,"_392":396,"_394":397},{"_384":391,"_392":393,"_394":395},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Proje